[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_vr_readme"]
script = ExtResource("2_mphrq")
body = "[b]PLACEHOLDER DRIVE[/b]

The records vault's console (the tape cage). It is wired up; its contents are not written yet.

The folders follow the vault's three zones: DRAWINGS (the plan chests and the pinned sheets), FILES (the stacks and cabinets), TAPES (the tape cabinets in this cage).

Edit res://content/terminals/vault_records.tres in the Godot inspector or as text."
name = "README.TXT"
meta = "PLACEHOLDER"

